## Using Up-to-Date Information

- **Always look up the latest documentation** when working with libraries, frameworks, APIs, CLIs, or cloud services — even familiar ones. Training data may be stale. Use web search (and the web-strip fetch tool to read pages cleanly) to verify current behavior, API signatures, and best practices before relying on memory.
